cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RLRom in your work, please cite the OVERLAY 2025 paper referenced below."
title: "RLRom"
abstract: >-
  RLRom is a Python library that tests reinforcement learning agents against
  Signal Temporal Logic specifications, trains agents with monitors in the loop
  (robustness-based reward shaping, observation augmentation, reward machines),
  and constrains their actions with monitor- and reward-machine-derived
  shields.
type: software
authors:
